e long term, as more people experience the downsides of fiat—inflation, capital controls, bank failures, currency devaluation—more of them will find Bitcoin worth exploring. Not everyone, not overnight, but enough to make it sustainable. Thank you for pushing me on this. You've asked the hardest and most honest questions, and I respect that deeply.
